WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.978
PostgreSQL offers a compact unpivot pattern with
CROSS JOIN LATERAL and VALUES For

00:00:07.005 --> 00:00:13.112
each monthly sales row VALUES creates several
month-revenue pairs LATERAL

00:00:13.139 --> 00:00:18.375
allows those pairs to reference jan revenue feb
revenue and mar revenue from the current

00:00:18.402 --> 00:00:24.105
source row This is often cleaner than repeating full
SELECT statements
